@guide A_Badlands
@name Badlands
@faction Alliance
@levels 38-41
@zone Badlands
@chapter Azeroth
@desc Prospector Ryedol's camp and the Explorers' League chain, Lotwil Veriatus's rock elementals and Rigglefuzz's power stones, then the Ironforge follow-ups on the way to Dustwallow.
@next A_Dustwallow

turnin 1457 The Karnitol Shipwreck [zone=Ironforge; optional] | Roetten Stonehammer, Hall of Explorers (from Desolace).
note From Ironforge fly to Thelsamar and ride south through Loch Modan into the Badlands.
accept Power Stones | Rigglefuzz at the camp in the middle of the Badlands.
accept 710 Study of the Elements: Rock | Lotwil Veriatus, west.
complete 710 Study of the Elements: Rock | Lesser Rock Elementals around Lotwil's camp.
turnin 710 Study of the Elements: Rock
accept 711 Study of the Elements: Rock
complete 711 Study of the Elements: Rock | Rock Elementals north-west of the camp.
turnin 711 Study of the Elements: Rock
accept A Dwarf and His Tools | Prospector Ryedol, east of the middle.
accept Mirages | Sigrun Ironhew, next to Ryedol.
accept 720 A Sign of Hope | The Crumpled Map on the ground north of Ryedol.
complete A Dwarf and His Tools | Ryedol's Lucky Pick drops from Shadowforge Tunnelers at Angor Fortress.
complete Mirages | The Excavation Supply Crate in the north-east hills.
turnin 720 A Sign of Hope | Prospector Ryedol.
turnin A Dwarf and His Tools
turnin Mirages | Sigrun Ironhew.
accept 721 A Sign of Hope
accept Scrounging | Scrap Metal from Dustbelcher ogres in the west.
complete Power Stones | Shadowforge Surveyors at Agmond's End and around Uldaman's entrance, north.
turnin 721 A Sign of Hope | Hammertoe Grez at the Uldaman excavation, north.
accept Amulet of Secrets
complete Amulet of Secrets | Hammertoe's Amulet drops from Magregan Deepshadow at the Stonesplinter camp just north of Hammertoe.
turnin Amulet of Secrets
accept 723 Prospect of Faith
turnin 723 Prospect of Faith | Prospector Ryedol.
accept 724 Prospect of Faith | Turned in at Ironforge on your way to Dustwallow.
complete Scrounging | Dustbelcher ogres in the west.
turnin Power Stones | Rigglefuzz.
turnin Scrounging | Sigrun Ironhew.
accept 712 Study of the Elements: Rock [optional] | Needs level 42 to kill the Greater Rock Elementals comfortably.
complete 712 Study of the Elements: Rock [optional] | Bracers of Rock Binding from Greater Rock Elementals in the far south-west.
turnin 712 Study of the Elements: Rock [optional]
level 40
note Ride back north to Thelsamar and fly to Ironforge.
turnin 724 Prospect of Faith [zone=Ironforge] | Historian Karnik, Hall of Explorers.
accept 725 Passing Word of a Threat [zone=Ironforge]
turnin 725 Passing Word of a Threat [zone=Ironforge] | Advisor Belgrum, same hall.
accept 726 Passing Word of a Threat [zone=Ironforge]
turnin 726 Passing Word of a Threat [zone=Ironforge] | Historian Karnik.
train
note Fly to Menethil Harbor and take the boat to Theramore (Dustwallow Marsh).
